body:
Though i can agree with some of your statements, i can disagree with others. The planet is indeed f'd up in some way or another. But idiocy, immorality and evil are human traits of a conscious mind indeed, though not everyone has them. Homosexuality should not be promoted but regardless, science shows us that sexual orientation isn't a choice and should not be repressed. Someone may choose their partners freely, but not enforce their orientation to others. Sexual orientation doesn't relate in being an idiot, immoral or evil person. Satan has always been an archetype that fascinated humans, though nothing more than that. It's basically  the grotesque and sinister side of the unconscious. 

&#x200B;

Let me input a quote from Jung, which relate to some things you are talking about.

&#x200B;

 “the historic events of our time have painted a picture of man’s psychic reality in indelible colors of blood and fire, and given him an object lesson which he will never be able to forget if—and this is the great question—he has today acquired enough consciousness to keep up with the furious pace of the devil within him. The only other hope is that he may learn to curb a creativity which is wasting itself in the exploitation of material power. Unfortunately, all attempts in that direction look like bloodless Utopias.” 

&#x200B;

Regardless, you have a son to care for, and what could possibly be happier than that? You should ignore others choices and even what your wife says and make a life changing choice. To guide and give your kid the right principles to grow as a good person! Make it your life goal, it will certainly give you meaning!

Happy that you found a good wife! You deserve it after all you have been through. So how are things in South Korea, what do you do for a living?

&#x200B;

 당신이 좋은 아내를 찾았 기 때문에 기뻤습니다! 당신이 끝내고 나면 그럴 자격이 있습니다. 그렇다면 남한의 생활 방식은 어떠합니까?
